\newlabel{tab:reach}{{1}{6}{\textbf {Step training reaches an exact solution in time growing about linearly in $n$.} One-block reduction, counting with $p=\frac 14$, full-batch gradient descent from small initialization. Rows 1--2: medians over five seeds, step size $0.5$; over all $\initscale \in \{0.005,0.01,0.02,0.05\}$ the fitted exponent of $n$ is $0.88$ ($K=2$) and $0.82$ ($K=3$). Row 3: two seeds, step size $2$}{table.caption.9}{}}
